{"id": 3, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n* Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating pesky germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.\n* Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n* Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.\n\nTherefore, using a water pick can be an effective addition to your oral hygiene routine, complementing traditional brushing and flossing methods.", "response": "Water Pik's benefits include:", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 4.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 15}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 4, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what is the proper way to dispose of a worn usa flag", "ground_truth": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is either by separating the blue field from the flag and burning it in a peaceful manner before burying the ashes, or by conducting a proper ceremony where the flag is folded in the customary triangle fold and then burned.", "response": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn the flag yourself in a proper ceremony. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold before burning.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 18}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 66.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 5, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to cook brats", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, here is how to cook brats:\n\nStep 1: Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n\nStep 2: Lightly oil the grate.\n\nStep 3: Combine beer and onions in a large pot, bring to a boil, and submerge the bratwurst. Add red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.\n\nStep 4: Simmer the bratwurst in the beer mixture for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally to brown evenly.\n\nStep 5: Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and grill it on the preheated grill for an additional 5 to 10 minutes, turning occasionally, until browned and cooked through.\n\nStep 6: Serve the bratwurst with the beer mixture as a topping or side dish.\n\nNote: It's important to prick the bratwurst with a fork before cooking to prevent them from exploding while cooking. Also, cooked bratwurst can be stored in the fridge for up to 5 days or frozen for up to 3 months.", "response": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat, lightly oil the grate, place the brats on the grill, and cook for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally to brown evenly.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 4}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.8, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 6, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to prepare blood slide", "ground_truth": "Sure, I can help you with that! Based on the given passages, here are the steps to prepare a blood slide:\n\n1. Sterilize the needle with a flame before using it to prick your finger or obtain blood from another source.\n2. Place a clean glass slide on a flat surface.\n3. Add one small drop of blood to one end of the slide.\n4. Hold another clean slide at an angle of about 45 degrees and gently touch the blood with one end of the slide, allowing the blood to run along the edge of the slide by capillary action.\n5. Carefully push the slide along the length of the first slide to produce a thin smear of blood.\n6. Repeat step 4 and 5 to make two smears.\n7. Allow the slides to air dry.\n8. Label the slides clearly once they are dry.\n9. Place the slides in provided slide transport containers.\n\nNote: It is important to avoid coming into contact with another person's blood, and to wear rubber gloves if it is unavoidable.", "response": "Place a clean glass slide on a flat surface, add one small drop of blood to one end, take another clean slide, hold it at an angle of about 45 degrees", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 12}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.99, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 7, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "ground_truth": "To sync an audiobook from iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n\n1. Open iTunes on your computer.\n2. Turn on the Manually manage music setting in iTunes.\n3. Download the audiobook from iTunes onto your iPhone.\n4. Connect your iPhone to the USB cable and plug the other end of the USB cable into a USB port on the computer.\n5. Wait for iTunes to sync the audiobook to your iPhone.\n6. After the sync is complete, the audiobook will be on your iPhone.", "response": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 13}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 8, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "ground_truth": "The Windward Islands are exposed to the wind of the northeast trade winds and are located on the southeastern side of the Caribbean Sea. The Leeward Islands, on the other hand, are located on the northwestern side of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind. The windward side receives more rain and is wetter, while the leeward side is drier but still receives some rain.", "response": "The difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Leeward Islands are away from the wind and are drier, while the Windward Islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 9}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 50.91, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 9, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how are water shares transferred", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, water shares can be transferred as follows:\n\n1. The current owner of the Water Stock Certificate must return the original certificate to the company and sign the back of the certificate.\n2. The new owner must provide proof of ownership and pay a fee of $75.00 to process the transfer.\n3. A new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner of record.\n\nPlease note that the passages only refer to the transfer of Water Stock Certificates and do not provide information on other types of water rights or transfers. Therefore, if the question is asking about other types of water rights or transfers, I would be unable to answer based on the given passages.", "response": "The process of transferring water shares involves returning the Water Stock Certificate, providing proof of ownership, and paying a $75.00 fee to process the transfer. A new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner of record.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 4}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 39.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 10, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "building a lean-to shed", "ground_truth": "Sure! Here's my attempt to answer your question based on the provided passages:\n\nHow do you prepare the site for building a lean-to shed?\n\nAccording to passage 1, step 1, you should prepare the site by laying down a 4\" layer of compacted gravel. This will provide a stable base for the shed's foundation. Additionally, passage 2 mentions cutting two pressure-treated 4x4s to a length of 6 feet for the skids, which will serve as the foundation for the shed. Finally, passage 3 provides instructions for building the shed's floor, including cutting rim joists to a length of 6 feet. Based on these passages, it appears that preparing the site involves laying down a layer of gravel and setting the skids in place before constructing the floor.", "response": "To build a lean-to shed, start by preparing the site with a 4-inch layer of compacted gravel. Next, cut two 4 x 4 skids to the appropriate length and set them on the site following the shed building plans. Cut two 2 x 6 rim joists and six joists to the correct lengths, then assemble the floor and set it on the skids. Check for square and anchor the frame to the skids with four joist clip angles.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 3}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 11, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what is the treatment when asset is discarded as per income tax act", "ground_truth": "Based on the Income Tax Act, when an asset is discarded but not sold, the scrap value of the asset can be reduced from the block in the previous year in which the asset is discarded as per section 43(6). This is done under the block concept, where all assets of the same class and subject to the same rate of depreciation are considered as a single asset. Any changes to the block's value must abide by the provisions of Chapter IV D of the Income Tax Act, 1961. Additionally, the assessee can claim depreciation on the residual value of such discarded asset, even if it's not used for the purposes of business or profession in that year and subsequent years.", "response": "The scrap value of the asset is reduced from the block in the previous year in which such asset is discarded.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 11}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.1, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 12, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to factory reset a htc one vx", "ground_truth": "To factory reset an HTC One VX, you can follow the steps mentioned in passage 3. Slide the Notifications panel open, tap on Storage, then Factory data reset, and finally tap on Reset phone and Erase everything.", "response": "To factory reset a HTC One VX, switch off the phone by using the Power rocker, press and hold Volum Down and Power buttons together for a couple of seconds, choose the Factory Reset by pressing the Volum Down button to scroll and Power key to select, and then press and hold the Volume Down + Power key for a couple of seconds.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 3.6, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 13}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 13, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to soften sugar", "ground_truth": "Based on the provided passages, here are some ways to soften sugar:\n\n1. To soften brown sugar, place it in a plastic container with a small piece of plastic wrap or foil over the sugar, and cover tightly. Remove the damp paper towel after a couple of days. (Passage 1)\n2. To soften hardened granulated sugar, preheat the oven to a low temperature (150-200°F), remove the sugar from its package, and place it in an ovenproof container. Warm the sugar in the oven for about 15 minutes, then tap it with a spoon. If it starts to fall apart, leave it in the oven for a longer period of time to completely dry out. Always store granulated sugar in an airtight container. (Passage 2)\n3. To keep brown sugar soft, pack it into the smallest container possible to minimize air exposure. (Passage 3)\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide information on how to soften other types of sugar, such as confectioner's sugar.", "response": "To soften hardened sugar, preheat the oven to the lowest temperature (150-200 degrees), remove the sugar from the package, and place it in an ovenproof container. Place the container in the warm oven for approximately 15 minutes. Tap the sugar with a spoon. If it starts to fall apart, turn off the oven and leave the sugar in the oven for an hour or two to completely dry out. Always store granulated sugar in an airtight container.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 5}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 47.74, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 14, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how long does it take to make chicken tender in crock pot", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, the answer to the question \"How long does it take to make chicken tender in a crock pot?\" is:\n\n6-8 hours on low heat, or 4 hours on high heat if you're short on time.\n\nThe first passage suggests cooking the chicken on low for 6-8 hours, or 1 hour on high and then 5 hours on low. The second passage repeats the same information. The third passage provides additional information that chicken breast will always come out tender as long as there is enough moisture, and suggests cooking it for 4 hours on high if you're short on time.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question is 6-8 hours on low heat, or 4 hours on high heat if you're short on time.", "response": "6 - 8 hours", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 8}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 2.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 15, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what is chard vegetable", "ground_truth": "Chard, also known as Swiss chard, is a vegetable with large, fleshy but tender deep green leaves and thick, crisp stalks. It has a flavor that is stronger and more assertive than spinach, and some people find it bitter. Chard can be eaten raw in salads when it's young, but mature leaves and stalks are usually cooked or sautéed. Chard is actually a type of beet that is grown for its leaves rather than its root. It can produce white, yellow, or red leaf stalks. Chard is highly perishable and should be kept in the refrigerator for only 2 to 3 days.", "response": "Chard is a leafy green vegetable that is part of the beet family. It has large, fleshy but tender deep green leaves and thick, crisp stalks. Chard can be used both raw in salads or cooked.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 3.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 9}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.3, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 16, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "differences between elements compounds and mixtures", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, the main differences between elements, compounds, and mixtures are:\n\n* Elements are the purest form of a chemical substance and are composed of only one type of atom. They have a fixed composition and cannot be broken down into simpler substances by physical means.\n* Compounds, on the other hand, are substances composed of two or more different elements that are chemically bonded together. They have a fixed composition and are pure substances.\n* Mixtures are physical combinations of elements or compounds where the parts of the mixture are not chemically bonded and retain their own identity. They have a variable composition and can be separated by physical means.\n\nTherefore, the key differences between elements, compounds, and mixtures are their composition, bonding, and separability. Elements are homogeneous and have a fixed composition, compounds are heterogeneous and have a fixed composition, and mixtures are heterogeneous and have a variable composition. Additionally, elements and compounds are chemically bonded, while mixtures are not.", "response": "Mixtures can be physically separated, while compounds cannot be easily separated. Mixtures have variable composition, while compounds have a fixed composition. Elements are composed of only one type of atom, while compounds are composed of two or more different elements.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 6}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 39.42, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 17, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to fix lift valve in toilet", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fix a lift valve in a toilet:\n\n1. Shut off the water supply valve to the toilet.\n2. Remove the old flapper valve and any remaining pieces of the broken lift chain from the lift arm.\n3. Install the new flapper valve and connect the chain to the third hole on the lift arm, making sure it is securely fastened.\n4. Open the water valve to fill the tank and flush the toilet to test for correct operation.\n5. Adjust the chain as needed to ensure a proper flush. Cut off any excess chain to prevent tangling.\n\nNote: If the toilet flushes slowly, adjust the chain to make it a little tighter on the lift arm.", "response": "To fix a lift valve in a toilet, follow these steps:", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 3.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 12}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.49, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 18, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how do crab traps work", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, here's how crab traps work:\n\nCrab traps are large square structures made of wire or flat metal mesh, with two ends that angle into the trap from the sides and bottom, leading to a narrow slit about 2 feet into the pot. This slit is the only entrance into the trap. Crabs are attracted to bait inside the pot and must crawl up the leads to reach it, but once they enter, they cannot escape due to the narrow opening. The pot is designed to allow crabs in but not let them out, making it an effective tool for catching crabs.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"How do crab traps work?\" is: Crab traps work by using a system of nets inside a large metal cage with a narrow entrance that allows crabs to enter but not exit, making it an effective tool for catching crabs.", "response": "Crab traps work by using a system of nets inside a large metal cage made of wire or flat metal mesh that is reinforced with steel bars. The crabs must crawl up the leads to get to their free meal.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 3.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 9}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 19, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to grill pork chops, allrecipes.com", "ground_truth": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to grill pork chops according to Allrecipes.com:\n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, and lightly oil the grate. (Passage 1)\n2. In a bowl, mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until thoroughly combined. Rinse pork chops, and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. (Passage 1)\n3. For Oven-Fried Pork Chops, use stuffing mix for the breading. The pork chops come out tender and juicy. This recipe takes 30 minutes to prepare and 10 minutes to prep. (Passage 2)\n4. To grill pork chops over indirect heat, rinse the chops and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. Massage the spice rub into the meat for 10 minutes before grilling. Grill the chops until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side. (Passage 3)\n\nTherefore, to grill pork chops according to Allrecipes.com, you should preheat the grill, season the pork chops with a spice mixture, and grill them over indirect heat until they are cooked through.", "response": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat, lightly oil the grate, mix the seasoning, rinse and season pork chops, and grill the chops over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 4.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 12}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.93, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 20, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n* Helping to increase oxygen efficiency in the blood\n* Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable\n* Enhancing nutrient absorption, particularly when taken with Co-enzyme Q10\n* Relieving muscular aches and pains\n* Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis\n\nTherefore, MSM powder has several benefits for overall health and wellness, including improved oxygenation, energy, and reduction of pain and inflammation.", "response": "MSM powder benefits the body by helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels, aiding in the absorption of nutrients, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.6, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 7}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 53.01, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 21, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "difference between an adverb clause and an adjective clause", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, an adverb clause modifies a verb, adjective or another adverb, while an adjective clause modifies a noun or pronoun.", "response": "An adverb clause modifies a verb, adjective, or another adverb, usually the verb, and is introduced by subordinate conjunctions. An adjective clause modifies a noun or pronoun and begins with a relative pronoun.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 4}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 68.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 22, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what are examples of potential and kinetic energy?", "ground_truth": "Examples of kinetic energy include an airplane in flight, due to its large mass and fast velocity, and a baseball thrown by a pitcher, which can have a large amount of kinetic energy due to its fast velocity. Examples of potential energy include gravitational potential energy, which is the energy stored in an object as the result of its vertical position or height, and elastic potential energy. Other activities like a car moving, a ball rolling, a river flowing, an athlete running, rides in an amusement park, and a satellite in orbit also involve potential and kinetic energy.", "response": "An example of gravitational potential energy is the energy stored in an object as the result of its vertical position or height. For instance, an athlete running up a hill stores gravitational potential energy in their body. An example of kinetic energy is the energy a body possesses by its motion. For instance, a ball rolling on the ground or a car moving on the road possess kinetic energy.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 8}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 47.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 23, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what causes watermelons to explode", "ground_truth": "Watermelons can explode due to external pressure, such as when a bunch of rubber bands are placed around the middle of the watermelon, causing potential energy to build up and eventually cause the watermelon to explode. Another cause of watermelon explosions is the buildup of gas inside the watermelon due to rotting. This increases the internal pressure and when the skin of the watermelon can no longer hold the gas inside, it will explode.", "response": "Rubber bands and rotting cause watermelons to explode.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 7}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.64, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 24, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to boil potatoes for easy peeling", "ground_truth": "Based on the provided passages, here's how to boil potatoes for easy peeling:\n\nPassage 1 recommends boiling the potatoes until they are tender, then transferring them to an ice water bath to stop the cooking process. After cooling, the skin can be easily peeled off. This method takes 15 minutes to cook the potatoes and 5 seconds to peel each one.\n\nPassage 2 suggests peeling the potatoes before cooking, as their skin can be tough and papery. However, no specific instructions are provided for peeling.\n\nPassage 3 provides a step-by-step guide for peeling cooked potatoes. The method involves scoring the potatoes all the way around the center, boiling them for about 15 minutes, then placing them in an ice water bath to cool. Once cooled, the skin can be easily removed. This method takes about 30 minutes total time.\n\nTherefore, based on the provided passages, the best way to boil potatoes for easy peeling is to boil them until tender, then transfer them to an ice water bath to stop the cooking process and make the skin easier to remove. Scoring the potatoes before boiling can also help loosen the skin for easier peeling.", "response": "Boil the potatoes for about 15 minutes, then transfer them to an ice water bath. When they are cool enough to handle, peel off the skin.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 13}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.95, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 25, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to make ribs", "ground_truth": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to make ribs:\n\nTo grill the ribs:\n\n1. Heat a gas or charcoal grill to medium temperature (350°F to 450°F).\n2. Remove the ribs from the foil, place them meaty-side up on the grill, and brush them with some of the sauce.\n3. Cover the grill and cook for 5 minutes.\n4. Flip and brush the ribs and cook for another 5 minutes.\n5. Continue to cook, flipping and brushing every 5 minutes, until the sauce has thickened and the ribs are heated through and have grill marks, for a total grilling time of 20 minutes.\n\nTo prepare the ribs before grilling:\n\n1. Lay the ribs on top of the rack in a single layer.\n2. Season the ribs by mixing the mustard and liquid smoke (if using), and brushing the ribs on both sides.\n3. Sprinkle the ribs with the dry rub and pat gently to make sure the rub adheres to the rib meat.\n\nFor oven-cooked BBQ ribs:\n\n1. Remove the membrane from the bottom of the ribs.\n2. Put the ribs in a resealable bag.\n3. Add sufficient BBQ sauce to cover the ribs.\n4. Line the baking pan with heavy-duty foil.\n5. Place the ribs in the baking pan and bake at 350°F for 2-3 hours, or until the ribs are tender and the meat starts to pull away from the bone.", "response": "To make ribs, first, heat the grill to medium (350°F to 450°F). Remove the ribs from the foil, place them meaty-side up on the grill, and brush them with some of the sauce. Cover the grill and cook for 5 minutes. Flip and brush the ribs and cook another 5 minutes. Continue to cook, flipping and brushing every 5 minutes, until the sauce has thickened and the ribs are heated through and have grill marks, for a total grilling time of 20 minutes.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 3.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 10}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 52.48, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 26, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what is company goodwill and why important", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, goodwill can be understood as a business asset that comes from a positive reputation and good connections with customers. It can be increased through providing good service or products, resulting in loyal and repeat customers who also spread positive reviews about the business. This goodwill attracts new customers, investors, and future buyers, making it an important factor in business success.", "response": "Company goodwill is the reputation and connection with customers, which contributes to a lasting relationship with customers and can attract new investors and buyers. It is important because it helps businesses retain old clients, increase their customer base", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 11}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 27, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to get antique effect on wood using normal paint", "ground_truth": "Based on the provided passages, here are some steps to achieve an antique effect on wood using normal paint:\n\n1. Apply a basecoat of flat or satin paint to the wood surface ( passage 3). Satin paint is easier to work with, but flat paint will give a more aged look.\n2. Mix paint that is two shades darker than the basecoat with an equal amount of glaze ( passage 3). Once the basecoat is dry, drizzle a crumpled rag or plastic bag in the glaze mixture to achieve an aged appearance.\n3. Layer stain on top of the paint to create a cool effect ( passage 1). This technique involves applying multiple layers of stain and allowing them to dry between coats.\n4. Use a palette knife to spread a mixture of molding paste and a rust or dull color on a canvas, letting it dry before adding additional layers ( passage 2). This can help create an embossed design with an antique finish.\n5. Apply a thin layer of burnt sienna or a similar color to give the wood a vintage look ( passage 3). Dabbing the paint with a paper towel or cloth can help remove excess paint and achieve a more subtle, aged appearance.\n\nOverall, the key to achieving an antique effect on wood using normal paint is to layer different materials and colors to create a weathered and worn appearance.", "response": "To achieve an antique effect on wood using normal paint, you can use a glaze technique. Mix paint that's two shades darker than your basecoat with an equal amount of glaze. Once your basecoat dries, drip a crumpled rag or plastic bag in the glaze mixture.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 4}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 28, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to arrange an excel sheet alphabetical", "ground_truth": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to arrange an Excel sheet alphabetically:\n\nPassage 1 suggests using Kutools for Excel, which provides a Sort Sheets tool to easily sort all worksheets in alphabetical order. However, if you prefer not to use macros or Kutools, Passage 2 provides an alternative method using the built-in Sort feature in Excel.\n\nTo sort an Excel sheet alphabetically using the built-in Sort feature, follow these steps:\n\n1. Select the data you wish to sort by clicking on the Select All button at the intersection of your row and column headings.\n2. Switch to the Data tab in the Microsoft Excel ribbon and locate the Sort & Filter group.\n3. Click on the Sort option.\n4. Click on the Sort By drop-down menu and select the column you wish to sort by (e.g., Product column in alphabetical order - A to Z).\n5. Click OK.\n\nOnce you have completed these steps, the data in your Excel sheet will be sorted alphabetically.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide sufficient information to clarify how to arrange an Excel sheet numerically.", "response": "To arrange an Excel sheet alphabetically, you can follow these steps: Click on the Select All button to highlight all cells in your worksheet. Then, switch to the Data tab in the Microsoft Excel ribbon and locate the Sort & Filter group. Click on the Sort option, and then click on the Sort By drop-down menu to select the column by name that you want to sort alphabetically.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 3}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 40.7, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 29, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "2006 chevy remove door panel", "ground_truth": "To remove the door panel on a 2006 Chevy, you will need to remove the screws inside the door pull cup and one in the middle of the inside door handle. There is also a pin on the outer edge of the door that needs to be removed. Use a door panel removal tool to pry the panel off.", "response": "To remove the rear door panel in your Chevy HHR, you will need to remove the two screws located inside of the door pull cup, and there's also one in the middle of the inside door handle. On the outer edge of the door there's also a pin the holds the panel in place, you will need to remove that. Then use a door panel removal tool to pry the door panel off of the HHR rear door.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 7}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 72.94, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 30, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to make panko crumbs", "ground_truth": "Sure, I can help you with that! Based on the given passages, here's a step-by-step guide on how to make panko crumbs:\n\n1. Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C).\n2. Push torn pieces of bread or chunks of white bread through the shredding disk of a food processor to make coarse crumbs.\n3. Spread the crumbs on a baking sheet.\n4. Bake in preheated oven until crumbs are dry but not toasted, 6 to 8 minutes. Shake the sheet twice during baking to evenly dry the crumbs.\n5. Remove from the oven and cool completely.\n\nIf you want to store the panko crumbs for later use, you can transfer them to an airtight container and keep them at room temperature for up to 2 weeks.\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.", "response": "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F. Push torn pieces of bread through the shredding disk of a food processor to make coarse crumbs. Spread the crumbs on a baking sheet and bake at 300 F degrees until the crumbs are dry but not toasted, about 6 to 8 minutes. Shake the sheet twice during baking. Remove from the oven and cool completely.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 4.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 12}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 55.32, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 31, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what is a upc description", "ground_truth": "Based on the provided passages, an UPDescription is:\n\n1. A barcode symbology used for tracking trade items in stores, consisting of 12 numeric digits that are uniquely assigned to each trade item. (Passage 1)\n2. A process involving receiving a specimen bottle from a member, ensuring it contains a minimum of 30 milliliters of urine, initialing the label in the member's presence, and verifying the information on the label and DD Form 2624 (a military form). (Passage 2)\n3. A barcode partner that provides GS1 Originated UPC and EAN codes, as well as a toll-free number and positive customer reviews. (Passage 3)\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "response": "The Universal Product Code (UPC) is a barcode symbology widely used in the United States, Canada, United Kingdom, Australia, New Zealand, and other countries for tracking trade items in stores. It consists of 12 numeric digits that are uniquely assigned to each trade item. The UPC is mainly used for scanning trade items at the point of sale, per GS1 specifications.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 3}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 32, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to clean tarnished jewelry at home", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, here's a brief answer to the question \"How to clean tarnished jewelry at home\":\n\nTo clean tarnished jewelry at home, mix a few drops of mild dish soap with warm water and dip a soft cloth in the solution. Rub the jewelry gently, then rinse it in cool water and buff it with a cloth until dry. For heavier tarnish, mix a paste of three parts baking soda to one part water and apply it with a soft, lint-free cloth. You can also use a saltwater solution by pouring two cups of hot water into a bowl and submerging the jewelry in it. Let it sit for a while, then remove and rinse it with cool water. Be sure to use a soft-bristle brush or old toothbrush to clean diamonds.", "response": "To clean tarnished jewelry at home, you can use a mixture of mild dish soap and warm water to clean dull, filmy, or discoloring items. For heavier tarnish, a paste of three parts baking soda to one part water can be used. For diamonds, the best way to clean them is with warm soapy water and a soft-bristle brush or old toothbrush.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 14}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 49.21, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 33, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how do i file a lien on a semi", "ground_truth": "Unable to answer based on given passages. The passages provided do not contain information on how to file a lien on a semi. Passage 1 discusses the possibility of a creditor placing a lien on a home that has been transferred to a spouse, while passage 2 explains the general process for placing a lien on business property but does not mention semis specifically. Passage 3 describes the documentation and distribution of copies of a lien entry form, but does not provide instructions on how to file a lien. Therefore, without additional information, it is impossible to provide an answer to the question.", "response": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 7}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 34, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "ground_truth": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of cupping massage:\n\n* Eliminates toxins\n* Improves circulation\n* Provides pain relief\n* Reduces inflammation\n* Has therapeutic benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression\n\nAccording to the passages, cupping massage can help remove toxins from the body, increase blood flow, relieve pain, and have a positive impact on mental well-being.", "response": "The benefits of cupping massage include eliminating toxins, improving circulation, providing pain relief, and offering mental benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 5}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 36.07, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 35, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "change of address u.s. postal service", "ground_truth": "To change your US postal address, you can visit the official website of the U.S. Postal Service, fill out an online form, or contact their call center. The process is fast and versatile, allowing you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the USPS. It's important to note that you can also use this feature to have your business mail forwarded to a new address due to a permanent move or temporary relocation. The process involves submitting either an online form or filling out and submitting a physical form at any U.S. Post Office.", "response": "The U.S. Postal Service offers three ways to change your address: visiting the official website, contacting the USPS Call Center, and filling out and submitting PS Form 3575.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 5}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 36, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how can you tell who liked your tweet", "ground_truth": "You can see who liked your tweets by using tracking websites such as Favotter.net and Favstar.fm. These sites can give you an idea of who is favouriting your tweets. Alternatively, you can also set up notifications on Twitter itself. By going to your account settings and clicking on the notifications link, you can arrange to be notified via email whenever someone likes one of your tweets.", "response": "You can tell who liked your tweet by using websites like **Favotter.net** or **Favstar.fm**", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 5}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.03, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 37, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "factors that cause oily skin", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, the factors that cause oily skin are primarily genetic/hereditary factors and hormonal shifts in the body. Diet and poor hygiene/topical applications have a limited effect on the oiliness of the skin. Combination skin, which is a mix of oily and dry/normal areas, can also contribute to oily skin in certain areas such as the T-zone.", "response": "Heredity and hormonal shifts.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 6}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 38, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how do raffles work", "ground_truth": "Raffles work by selling tickets to participants, who have the opportunity to win prizes. The specific details and mechanics of a raffle can vary. In a reverse raffle, participants purchase tickets with numbers on them, and the last ticket drawn wins the main prize. In a 50-50 draw, tickets are sold during an event, and 50% of the proceeds go to the winner of a random draw, while the other 50% is allocated for a charitable purpose. In some cases, raffles may also offer additional opportunities to win prizes, such as cash tip board raffles.", "response": "A raffle is a type of lottery where participants buy tickets with a chance to win a prize. The reverse raffle works by having participants buy tickets with numbers from 1 to approximately 55, and the table consists of 20 individuals, which constitutes one complete ticket at $1000. There are two $500 prizes, one for the early bird drawing and one for the first ticket pulled.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 1}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 39, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what are safety pins in a first aid box used for", "ground_truth": "Safety pins in a first aid box are used for various purposes such as immobilizing an arm by creating a makeshift sling, securing a bandana over a wounded arm or leg, closing severe wounds in emergency situations, and removing splinters.", "response": "immobilizing, securing bandages, keeping wounds closed, removing splinters", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 4}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 40, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what is a transistor how does it work", "ground_truth": "A transistor is a miniature electronic component made of semiconductor material with at least three terminals for connection to an external circuit. It can function as an amplifier or a switch. As an amplifier, it takes a small electric current at one end (input current) and produces a larger electric current (output current) at the other end. As a switch, it uses a small amount of electricity to control a gate on a larger supply of electricity. The transistor works when the electrons and the holes start moving across the two junctions between the n-type and p-type silicon. The current passes from the emitter to the collector through the base. The amount of collector current is approximately β (common-emitter current gain) times the base current.", "response": "A transistor is a miniature electronic component that can function as an amplifier or a switch. It works by using a small amount of electricity to control a gate on a much larger supply of electricity, much like turning a valve to control a supply of water. When it works as an amplifier, it takes in a tiny electric current at one end (an input current) and produces a much bigger electric current (an output current) at the other. Transistors can also work as switches.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 5}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 51.2, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 41, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "ground_truth": "To quickly get rid of mice, it is important to take immediate action as they can quickly infest your home. One effective method is to seal off any entry points that mice can use to enter your house, such as pipes and vents. Placing steel wool inside these openings before sealing them can prevent mice from reentering. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources and shelter can help deter mice from your home.", "response": "To quickly get rid of mice, take immediate action by sealing entry points effectively. Consider using steel wool pads for added protection, especially if the mice are persistent and resilient. Eliminate any food sources that the mice can access, and learn how to prevent them from returning to your home.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 5}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.94, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 42, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "which is better exercise cycling or aerobic", "ground_truth": "The passages suggest that both cycling and aerobic exercise are beneficial. However, cycling, including stationary cycling, may be particularly ideal for individuals with arthritic or other orthopedic problems who may have difficulty walking for extended periods. Furthermore, stationary biking provides a low impact workout as it supports the majority of your weight. Therefore, while both exercises are valuable, the passages may imply that cycling could be better for those with specific physical conditions.", "response": "Aerobic exercise is better than cycling.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 6}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.55, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 43, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to force removal of a printer in devices and printers", "ground_truth": "Passage 2 provides the necessary information to force removal of a printer in devices and printers. You can do this by first clicking on Control Panel, then selecting Hardware and Sound, followed by clicking on Printers. Right-click on the printer you want to remove and click Delete. If you are unable to delete the printer, right-click it again, click Run as administrator, and then click Delete.", "response": "Close Print Manager or the Printers folder, stop and restart the Spooler Service.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "random_vetoed_path", "veto_total_penalty": 3.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 19}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 44, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, here is how to guard a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter when guarding them near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player.\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is essential to stay close to them, move quickly laterally to maintain position, and use a defensive strategy such as keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "response": "Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard him near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 9}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 51.02, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 45, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "ground_truth": "Jalapenos have health benefits such as pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant properties, and potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapenos can help defend heart health and provide cardiovascular benefits.", "response": "Pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant, prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, and their richness in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 4}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 58.82, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 46, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to plant a potato that has sprouted", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to plant a potato that has sprouted:\n\n1. Cut the sprouted potato into chunks with two or three eyes each, making sure to not break the long sprouts.\n2. Allow the cut ends to dry out overnight in a cool, dark location.\n3. Plant the potato chunks or whole potatoes in well-draining soil, spacing them 24 to 36 inches apart.\n4. Dig a trench about 4 inches wide and 6 to 8 inches deep, and place the potato pieces in the bottom of the trench with the sprouted side facing up.\n5. Cover the potatoes with a layer of compost and then replace the dirt on top of the plantings.\n\nNote that the passages do not provide specific information on how to care for the potatoes after planting, such as watering and fertilization.", "response": "To plant a sprouted potato, turn the soil over in your planned planting area to a depth of 12 inches and break it up finely. Remove any large rocks and other debris while hoeing. Dig a trench about 4 inches wide. Cut the potatoes into cubes, about 1 to 2 inches on each side, leaving a sprout on each cube. Nonsprouted sections should have two or three eyes on each. Place the cubes into the bottom of the trench, separating each cube from the other by about 6 to 8 inches. Place the sprouted or eye side of the cubes facing up. Cover the potatoes with a layer of compost and then replace the dirt on top of the plantings.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 11}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 46.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 47, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "ground_truth": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Rinse your hair completely with water.\n2. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\n3. Apply a conditioner and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n4. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n5. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles.\n\nAdditionally, it is recommended to use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair after washing, and to be gentle when handling wet hair to prevent damage.", "response": "To properly clean your hair, follow these steps: 1) Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. 2) Make sure the water is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly. 3) Thoroughly wet the hair. 4) Apply a small amount of shampoo to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles. 5) Rinse the hair completely. 6) Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes. 7) Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. 8) Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 3.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 9}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 58.82, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 48, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what happens when you breath in and out", "ground_truth": "Based on the provided passages, here are the answers to the question \"What happens when you breathe in and out?\":\n\nWhen you breathe in (inspiration):\n\n* The intercostal muscles contract, expanding the ribcage.\n* The diaphragm contracts, pulling downwards to increase the volume of the chest.\n* Pressure inside the chest is lowered and air is sucked into the lungs.\n\nWhen you breathe out (exhalation):\n\n* Your diaphragm relaxes and moves upward into the chest cavity.\n* The intercostal muscles between the ribs also relax to reduce the space in the chest cavity.\n* Air rich in carbon dioxide is forced out of your lungs and windpipe, and then out of your nose or mouth.\n\nTherefore, when you breathe in, the lungs take in oxygen-rich air, and when you breathe out, the lungs expel carbon dioxide-rich air.", "response": "When you breathe in, the intercostal muscles contract, expanding the ribcage, the diaphragm contracts, pulling downwards to increase the volume of the chest, and air is sucked into the lungs. When you breathe out, the diaphragm relaxes and moves upward, the intercostal muscles relax to reduce the space in the chest cavity, and air rich in carbon dioxide is forced out of the lungs.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 11}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 63.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 49, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "ground_truth": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea:\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Soothes the senses and relieves stress (Passage 1)\n* Provides relief from pain due to muscle, joint, or ligament injuries (Passage 2)\n* Soothes abdominal pain and aids in digestion (Passage 3)\n\nSide Effects:\n\n* None mentioned in the passages.\n\nNote that there are no side effects mentioned in the passages provided. However, it's important to note that consuming clove tea in large quantities can cause irritation to the stomach and digestive tract, so it's best to consume it in moderation.", "response": "soothes the senses, relieves stress, skin benefits, relieves pain, aids in digestion", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 8}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.78, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.7, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 50, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "How do you make ice cream", "ground_truth": "To make ice cream, you start by stirring sugar, cream, and milk into a saucepan over low heat until the sugar has dissolved. Heat just until the mix is hot and a small ring of foam appears around the edge. Next, transfer the cream mixture to a pourable container such as a large measuring cup and stir in vanilla extract. Chill the mix thoroughly, for at least 2 hours. Once chilled, pour the cold ice cream mix into an ice cream maker, turn on the machine, and churn according to manufacturer's directions for 20 to 25 minutes. When the ice cream is softly frozen, you can serve it immediately or place a piece of plastic wrap directly on the ice cream and place it in the freezer to ripen for 2 to 3 hours.", "response": "Stir sugar, cream, and milk into a saucepan over low heat until sugar has dissolved. Heat just until mix is hot and a small ring of foam appears around the edge. Transfer cream mixture to a pourable container such as a large measuring cup. Stir in vanilla extract and chill mix thoroughly, at least 2 hours. Pour cold ice cream mix into an ice cream maker, turn on the machine, and churn according to manufacturer's directions, 20 to 25 minutes. When ice cream is softly frozen, serve immediately or place a piece of plastic wrap directly on the ice cream and place in freezer to ripen, 2 to 3 hours.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 2.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 3}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 92.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.9, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 51, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what do the colors of the tennessee flag mean", "ground_truth": "The colors on the Tennessee Flag have significant meanings. The white color symbolizes purity, the blue color stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and the red color represents the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare. The three white stars within the blue circle symbolize the three disparate forms of land that divide the state.", "response": "The colors of the Tennessee flag represent purity (white), patriotism of the people of Tennessee (blue), and the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare (red).", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": false, "fallback_source": "none", "veto_total_penalty": 0.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 0}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 56.6, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 52, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "how to poach an egg using a poachpod", "ground_truth": "Sure! Here's how to poach an egg using a PoachPod® based on the provided passages:\n\n1. Bring a large pot of water to a boil. (Passage 1)\n2. Carefully crack an egg into the PoachPod®, being careful not to break the yolk. (Passage 2)\n3. Gently slide the PoachPod® into the boiling water, making sure it floats upright and no water enters the pod. (Passage 2)\n4. Cover the pot with a lid and cook for 6 minutes. (Passage 2)\n5. Use a large slotted spoon or tongs to carefully remove the PoachPod® from the water and flip it upside down over a plate. (Passage 2)\n6. Press gently on the bottom of the PoachPod® to release the poached egg onto the plate. (Passage 2)\n\nThat's it! According to the passages, the PoachPod® makes it easy to poach eggs by allowing you to float them in boiling water without breaking the yolk. Just make sure to lightly oil the pod before adding the egg to prevent sticking.", "response": "Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Crack an egg and gently slide it into the silicone poaching pod. Float the pod in the boiling water, making sure the pod stays upright and no water gets into the pod. Cover the pot with the lid and let the egg cook for six minutes. Remove the lid and use a large slotted spoon or tongs to lift the pod out of the hot water. Flip the pod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release your poached egg onto the plate.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 1.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 7}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 53.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": 53, "category": "", "sub_category": "unknown", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "ground_truth": "SMS stands for Short Message Service, commonly referred to as a text message, and allows you to send a text message of up to 160 characters to another device. MMS, which stands for Multimedia Messaging Service, is an evolution of SMS. It allows you to send messages that include pictures, video, or audio content to another device. MMS messages can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB. SMS is restricted to sending text-only messages, whereas MMS allows a combination of text, pictures, sounds, and videos.", "response": "SMS is restricted to text-only messages, while MMS allows sending a combination of text, pictures, sounds, and videos.", "status": "success", "path_info": {"fallback_triggered": true, "fallback_source": "best_surviving_path", "veto_total_penalty": 5.0, "veto_threshold_used": 0.45, "num_paths_explored": 24, "num_paths_vetoed": 5}, "layer_repair": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.8, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
